WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
In this phase of hepatic development and the establishment of gastric movement and

2
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:06.823
of the omental bursa, initially I have an anterior pancreas and

3
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.147
a dorsal pancreas.

4
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:23.210
In this phase of rotation, the anterior pancreas will make a large three-quarter

5
00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:23.980
movement, like this.

6
00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:26.910
It joins the posterior part and will form the two pancreases.

7
00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:28.910
An exocrine pancreas, an endocrine pancreas.

8
00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:33.100
A pancreas that will secrete everything related to the system of gastric juices,

9
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.410
pancreatic juices, i. e.

10
00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:35.810
