23
00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:13.130
It is very deep, very difficult to separate.

24
00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:14.820
They are completely attached.

25
00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:18.580
If I am cut in half here, and seen from above, it makes a movement like this.

26
00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:21.550
It makes this hepatic movement like this, which turns the...

